  "description": "(opt11) This domain is original from the learning part of IPC2008. The domain involves parking cars on a street with N curb locations, and where cars can be double-parked but not triple-parked. The goal is to find a plan to move from one configuration of parked cars to another configuration, by driving cars from one curb location to another. The problems in the competition contain 2*(N-1) cars, which allows one free curb space and guarantees solvability.",
